/// Expr — base class of every expression node (literals, variable paths,
/// filtered values, comparisons, `and` / `or`).
typed Value subclass: Expr

  /// Evaluate in `scope`. Returns `{value, errors}`; `errors` is a list of
  /// LiquidError (empty when everything resolved).
  eval: _scope :: Scope -> Tuple => self subclassResponsibility
